WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.381
Perimeter task 1: a rectangle is 2 cm long and 3 cm wide. What is its perimeter in

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:12.905
cm? Let us think carefully. Add every side: 2 plus 3 plus 2 plus 3 equals 10 cm. The

00:00:12.905 --> 00:00:14.621
answer is 10. Great work!

